#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.location
#: src/data/incidents.js:16
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.location"
msgid "Boundary Hall · Bell Tower"
msgstr "境界講堂・鐘楼"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:17
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.title"
msgid "Seven punctual students heard the latecomer-only bell"
msgstr "遅刻者だけに聞こえる鐘を、定刻の七名が聞いた"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.lede
#: src/data/incidents.js:18
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.lede"
msgid ""
"On the first trial day, the bell should have reached only latecomers. Seven "
"students with punctual records heard the same strike in different places; "
"three then left their next class early."
msgstr "試行初日、鐘は遅刻者だけへ届くはずだった。出席記録が正常な七名が別々の場所で同じ鐘を聞き、うち三名は次の授業を早退した。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.dispatch
#: src/data/incidents.js:19
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.dispatch"
msgid ""
"Automatic judgment is suspended; ordinary timekeeping remains active. Do not "
"be deliberately late for testing."
msgstr "自動判定を停止し、通常時報のみ継続。試験目的の意図的遅刻は禁止。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.affected
#: src/data/incidents.js:20
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.affected"
msgid "7 students, 2 classes, and 1 roll book insisting it is correct"
msgstr "学生7名・授業2件・誤りなしと主張する出席簿1冊"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.signal
#: src/data/incidents.js:21
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.signal"
msgid "Bell detection among non-targets"
msgstr "非対象者の鐘聴取率"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.unit
#: src/data/incidents.js:22
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.unit"
msgid "percentage points"
msgstr "パーセントポイント"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.0.roster-lag.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:26
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.0.roster-lag.1"
msgid "The roll clock lags behind the bell"
msgstr "出席簿の時刻が鐘楼より一刻遅い"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.0.roster-lag.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:26
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.0.roster-lag.2"
msgid ""
"The tower reads the submitted snapshot; classroom records show punctuality "
"after Keine’s annotation."
msgstr "鐘楼は提出時の写しを読み、教室側は慧音の追記後に定刻表示となった。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.1.wing-reflection.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:27
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.1.wing-reflection.1"
msgid "Large wings reflected the bell to bystanders"
msgstr "大型翼が鐘音を周囲へ反射した"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.1.wing-reflection.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:27
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.1.wing-reflection.2"
msgid ""
"Four of seven stood near the tengu approach, where sound may have bypassed "
"personal wards."
msgstr "七名中四名は天狗進入線付近におり、個別結界を回折した可能性がある。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.2.expectation.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:28
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.2.expectation.1"
msgid "The bulletin created an expectation of hearing it"
msgstr "速報が先に聴取期待を作った"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.2.expectation.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:28
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.hypotheses.2.expectation.2"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Campus News issued “Late Bell Rings” nine minutes before the trial."
msgstr "文々。学報は正式試行9分前に「遅刻鐘鳴る」の号外を出した。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:31
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.2"
msgid "Bell decision log v1.3"
msgstr "鐘楼判定記録 v1.3"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:31
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.3"
msgid ""
"Seven IDs were marked late at 08:09:58; the classroom roll shows 08:09:41. "
"The two systems do not share the same boundary for 08:10."
msgstr "七番号を08:09:58に遅刻判定。教室簿は08:09:41着席。二系統の「08:10」は同じ境界ではない。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:31
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.0.tower-log.4"
msgid "Kappa tower terminal"
msgstr "河童鐘楼端末"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:32
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.2"
msgid "Roll page annotated by Keine"
msgstr "慧音の追記入り出席頁"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:32
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.3"
msgid ""
"The “punctual” ink dried after the bell, but refers to an arrival before it. "
"Keine notes this is a correction, not time travel."
msgstr "「定刻」の墨は鐘後に乾いたが、記載された着席時刻は鐘前。追記は訂正で時間旅行ではない、と慧音注記。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:32
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.1.roll-page.4"
msgid "History & Records"
msgstr "歴史記録学部"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:33
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.2"
msgid "Four-way roof audio"
msgstr "屋上四方向録音"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:33
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.3"
msgid ""
"A 0.7-second echo appears north; only two affected students were there. Wing "
"reflection explains part, not all seven."
msgstr "北側に0.7秒反響。ただし該当者は二名のみ。翼面反射は一部を説明するが七名全員ではない。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:33
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.2.roof-audio.4"
msgid "Tengu Observatory"
msgstr "天狗観測所"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:34
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.2"
msgid "Extra edition nine minutes before the bell"
msgstr "鐘より9分早い号外"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:34
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.3"
msgid ""
"The headline says the bell rang; the body says it is due later. Aya says the "
"headline used “the present when readers reach the paper.”"
msgstr "見出しは鐘が鳴ったと断言、本文は「辰末に試行予定」。文は「読者が新聞へ到達する時点の現在」を採用したと説明。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:34
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.evidence.3.extra-edition.4"
msgid "Bunbunmaru clipping"
msgstr "文々。学報切抜"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:37
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.1"
msgid "Outside exchange student 17"
msgstr "外界交換生17号"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:37
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.2"
msgid "Affected student"
msgstr "該当者"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:37
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.3"
msgid ""
"I saw the extra first but assumed it was newspaper tense. I checked the roll "
"only after hearing the actual bell."
msgstr "先に号外を見たが新聞時制だと思った。実際に鐘を聞いてから出席簿を確認した。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:37
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.0.student-17.4"
msgid ""
"Expectation remains possible, but the student describes the northbound echo "
"after the strike."
msgstr "期待効果は除外できないが、鐘後の北向反響を記述できる。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:38
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.1"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:38
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.2"
msgid "Publisher / observer"
msgstr "発行者・観測者"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:38
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.3"
msgid ""
"I did not make the bell ring early. I merely knew it would ring before it "
"did. Journalism treats those very differently."
msgstr "鐘を早く鳴らしてはいない。鐘より先に鳴ると知っただけ。報道学上は大違いだ。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:38
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.4"
msgid "She controls part of the exposure and the first public narrative."
msgstr "曝露の一部と最初の公的叙述を同時に管理。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:39
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.1"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城にとり"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:39
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.2"
msgid "Equipment maintainer"
msgstr "設備保守"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:39
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.3"
msgid ""
"The tower clock is absolutely accurate. Whether it reads today’s roll was "
"not in my procurement specification."
msgstr "鐘楼時計は絶対正確。ただし読む出席簿が今日の版かは調達仕様にない。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:39
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.2.nitori.4"
msgid "Instrument time and data version are separate questions."
msgstr "設備時計と資料版は別問題。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:42
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.1"
msgid "Freeze the tower’s roll version"
msgstr "鐘楼の出席簿版を固定"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:42
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.2"
msgid "Use one roll snapshot throughout a trial, accepting Keine’s annotations afterward."
msgstr "一試行中は同一写しを使用し、慧音の追記は終了後に反映。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:42
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.0.freeze-roster.3"
msgid "Some corrected lateness remains temporarily visible."
msgstr "訂正済み遅刻が一時表示される。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:43
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.1"
msgid "Synchronise tower and classroom boundaries"
msgstr "鐘楼と教室の境界時刻を同期"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:43
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.2"
msgid "Mark 08:10 on both sides with one pulse without rewriting existing attendance."
msgstr "同じパルスで両側の08:10を標識し、既存記録は変更しない。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:43
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.1.calibrate-clocks.3"
msgid "Yukari wants the pulse’s side defined while it crosses."
msgstr "紫はパルス越境時の所属側を先に定義せよと要求。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:44
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.1"
msgid "Run one morning without advance headlines"
msgstr "速報なしで一朝盲検"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:44
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.2"
msgid "Journalism may observe, but publication waits until after the strike."
msgstr "報道学部は観測可、締切は鐘後。期待効果を測定。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:44
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.2.quiet-trial.3"
msgid "Aya has pre-filed “University Delays Vital Information.”"
msgstr "文は「大学、重要情報を遅延」の予備稿を提出済み。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:45
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.1"
msgid "Temporarily move the north large-wing berth"
msgstr "北側大型翼停泊線を一時移設"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:45
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.2"
msgid "Remove wing reflection from the next round and compare north with south."
msgstr "次回から翼面反射を除き南北差を比較。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:45
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.actions.3.move-berth.3"
msgid "Tengu students say the twelve-metre detour itself creates lateness."
msgstr "天狗学生は12メートル迂回自体が遅刻を生むと主張。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:48
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.author"
msgid "Bell Incident Desk"
msgstr "鐘楼事案連絡室"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:48
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.title"
msgid "Bell case closed: {finding}"
msgstr "鐘楼事案を終結：{finding}"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:48
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.0.body"
msgid "Action: {action}. Design identifiability {quality}/100; file {ref}."
msgstr "措置：{action}。設計識別度 {quality}/100、記録 {ref}。"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:49
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.author"
msgid "Seven punctual but unconvinced students"
msgstr "定刻だが納得していない七名"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:49
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.title"
msgid "So were we late or not?"
msgstr "結局、私たちは遅刻なのか"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:49
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.1.body"
msgid ""
"The study says {finding}; the registrar still has two times. Do appeals "
"attach the bell or the ink?"
msgstr "研究は {finding}。学務頁には時刻が二つ。異議には鐘音と墨のどちらを添付？"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:50
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.author"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Corrections"
msgstr "文々。学報訂正欄"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:50
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.title"
msgid "Correction: we did not advance the bell; the headline arrived early"
msgstr "訂正：本紙は鐘を早めず、見出しが早着した"

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:50
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.reactions.2.body"
msgid "We accept part of {ref}, while reserving editorial control over the boundary of “early.”"
msgstr "{ref} の一部結論を受け入れるが、「早い」の境界編集権は留保。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.location
#: src/data/incidents.js:60
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.location"
msgid "Bamboo Forest · Fourth Blue Lantern Line"
msgstr "迷いの竹林・第四青灯線"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:61
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.title"
msgid "Three rabbit shuttles arrived at the same “fourth lantern”"
msgstr "兎車三便が同じ「第四灯」へ連続到着"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.lede
#: src/data/incidents.js:62
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.lede"
msgid ""
"Three shuttles left by different routes and returned to the same platform "
"within twelve minutes. Conductors say the platform moved; the platform says "
"the vehicles never left."
msgstr "別経路で出た兎車三便が12分以内に同じ乗場へ戻った。車掌は乗場が動いたとし、乗場は車が出ていないと主張。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.dispatch
#: src/data/incidents.js:63
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.dispatch"
msgid ""
"Rabbit shuttles divert via lantern five. If another fifth lantern appears "
"first, do not use both."
msgstr "兎車は第五灯へ迂回。別の第五灯を先に見ても二つ同時に使わないこと。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.affected
#: src/data/incidents.js:64
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.affected"
msgid "43 passengers, 3 shuttles, at least 1 platform"
msgstr "乗客43名・兎車3便・乗場最低1基"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.signal
#: src/data/incidents.js:65
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.signal"
msgid "Shuttles reaching Eientei correctly"
msgstr "永遠亭へ正しく到着した便率"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.unit
#: src/data/incidents.js:66
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.unit"
msgid "percentage points"
msgstr "パーセントポイント"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.0.firmware-drift.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:70
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.0.firmware-drift.1"
msgid "The shuttles used different lantern firmware"
msgstr "三便が異なる灯番号ファームを使用"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.0.firmware-drift.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:70
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.0.firmware-drift.2"
msgid "Kappa terminals show v3.1b, v3.1b-really-fixed, and v3.2-do-not-release."
msgstr "河童端末に v3.1b・v3.1b-本当に修正・v3.2-未公開の三版。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.1.tewi-label.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:71
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.1.tewi-label.1"
msgid "Tewi labelled three lanterns as number four"
msgstr "因幡てゐが三灯を第四灯と表示"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.1.tewi-label.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:71
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.1.tewi-label.2"
msgid "Two removable ‘4’ labels were found; a third claims to be the factory plate."
msgstr "剥離可能な「四」札が二枚。三枚目は純正銘板を自称。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.2.lunar-fold.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:72
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.2.lunar-fold.1"
msgid "The waning moon folded three routes onto one platform"
msgstr "下弦月が三経路を同じ乗場へ折った"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.2.lunar-fold.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:72
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.hypotheses.2.lunar-fold.2"
msgid ""
"The anomaly appears when moonlight crosses the fourth bamboo joint, but two "
"cloud-cover intervals are missing."
msgstr "月光が第四竹節を通る時だけ異常。ただし当夜の雲量記録は二区間欠測。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:75
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.2"
msgid "Boot screens from three terminals"
msgstr "三端末の起動画面"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:75
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.3"
msgid ""
"Version strings and route-table checksums differ. Only v3.1b calls lantern "
"five’s coordinates lantern four."
msgstr "版文字列と経路表チェックサムが異なる。v3.1bだけが第五灯座標を第四灯と呼ぶ。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:75
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.0.firmware-stubs.4"
msgid "Kappa transit terminals"
msgstr "河童交通端末"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:76
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.2"
msgid "Two and a half ‘4’ labels"
msgstr "「四」札二枚半"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:76
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.3"
msgid ""
"Two use carrot paste; half a label sits inside a conductor’s cap. Tewi says "
"this proves only that someone values four."
msgstr "二枚は人参糊、半枚は車掌帽の裏。てゐは「四を重視する者」の証明に過ぎないと主張。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:76
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.1.paper-fours.4"
msgid "Scene collection bag"
msgstr "現場採取袋"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:77
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.2"
msgid "Moonlight and cloud log"
msgstr "月光・雲量記録"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:77
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.3"
msgid ""
"Two missing intervals cover the second and third returns. The sensor slept "
"because “a rabbit sat on it.”"
msgstr "欠測二区間は第二・三便の回転と一致。センサー休眠理由は「兎が座った」。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:77
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.2.moon-log.4"
msgid "Eientei weather rack"
msgstr "永遠亭気象架"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:78
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.2"
msgid "Punch times on 43 tickets"
msgstr "43枚の乗車券打刻"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:78
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.3"
msgid ""
"Trip times differ by 37 seconds each, matching terminal route recomputation "
"rather than moving an entire platform."
msgstr "三便の所要差は各37秒。端末再計算時間に一致し、乗場全体の移動とは合わない。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:78
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.evidence.3.ticket-times.4"
msgid "Rabbit shuttle fare box"
msgstr "兎車運賃箱"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:81
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.1"
msgid "White Rabbit Conductor 08"
msgstr "白兎車掌08"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:81
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.2"
msgid "First conductor"
msgstr "第一便車掌"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:81
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.3"
msgid ""
"I followed the terminal arrow. It was confident every time, which is often "
"worse than being correct."
msgstr "端末矢印に従った。矢印は毎回自信満々で、それは正しい時より厄介だ。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:81
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.0.conductor.4"
msgid "Experienced with equipment, but testified after seeing the version strings."
msgstr "設備に詳しいが、版文字列を見た後の証言。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:82
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.1"
msgid "Tewi Inaba"
msgstr "因幡てゐ"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:82
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.2"
msgid "Temporary route adviser (self-appointed)"
msgstr "臨時経路顧問（自称）"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:82
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.3"
msgid "If labels could move platforms, the kappa would already have bought my patent."
msgstr "札で乗場が動くなら、河童はとっくに特許を買っている。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:82
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.1.tewi.4"
msgid "Does not deny placing labels, only that labels have causal force."
msgstr "札を貼ったことは否定せず、因果力だけ否定。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:83
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.1"
msgid "Eirin Yagokoro"
msgstr "八意永琳"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:83
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.2"
msgid "Joint route manager"
msgstr "永遠亭経路共同管理"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:83
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.3"
msgid ""
"Moon phase can fold roads, but it does not name firmware. Repair what can be "
"repaired before debating what cannot."
msgstr "月相は道を折れるが版名は付けない。直せるものを先に直し、直せないものを後で議論する。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:83
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.testimony.2.eirin.4"
msgid "Prefers actionable explanations without excluding lunar interaction."
msgstr "操作可能な説明を優先するが、月相交互作用は除外せず。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:86
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.1"
msgid "Lock all shuttles to one firmware"
msgstr "三便を同一ファームへ固定"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:86
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.2"
msgid "Archive all three old images and read one route table during the trial."
msgstr "旧版三種を保存し、試験中は同一路線表のみ読取。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:86
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.0.lock-firmware.3"
msgid "Nitori requests the name final-final-really-this-time."
msgstr "にとりは版名を「final-final-今度こそ」と要求。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:87
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.1"
msgid "Recalibrate lantern numbers from coordinates"
msgstr "実座標で灯番号を再校正"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:87
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.2"
msgid "Renumber from survey posts, trusting neither labels nor self-description."
msgstr "札や自己申告を使わず測量杭で再番号付け。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:87
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.1.calibrate-lanterns.3"
msgid "Lantern three has applied to retain the right to be called four."
msgstr "第三灯は第四灯と呼ばれる権利を申請済み。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:88
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.1"
msgid "Add moonlight control shuttles"
msgstr "月光対照便を追加"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:88
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.2"
msgid "Run the same version on moon-screened and unscreened routes."
msgstr "同一版を遮月・非遮月経路で走行。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:88
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.2.cloud-control.3"
msgid "The moon screen may not be operated by rabbits who sit on sensors."
msgstr "遮月幕はセンサーに座る兎が操作してはならない。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:89
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.1"
msgid "Seal all movable number labels"
msgstr "可動数字札を全て封印"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:89
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.2"
msgid "Count labels and carrot-paste residue before and after each run."
msgstr "各便前後に札と人参糊残留を点検。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:89
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.actions.3.remove-labels.3"
msgid "Tewi proposes self-moving numerals, which the rule does not cover."
msgstr "てゐは自走文字への変更を提案。規則未対応。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:92
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.author"
msgid "Bamboo Transit Joint Desk"
msgstr "竹林交通共同室"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:92
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.title"
msgid "Fourth Lantern case closed: {finding}"
msgstr "第四灯事案を終結：{finding}"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:92
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.0.body"
msgid ""
"First action: {action}. Identifiability {quality}/100. Check both lantern "
"and version before boarding."
msgstr "先行措置：{action}。識別度 {quality}/100。乗車前は灯と版を確認。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:93
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.author"
msgid "Anonymous but fortunate rabbit"
msgstr "匿名だが幸運な兎"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:93
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.title"
msgid "For sale: two post-incident number-four labels"
msgstr "「四」札二枚、事案後記念版"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:93
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.1.body"
msgid ""
"The study says {finding}, so the labels should have lost transit function. "
"No warranty on collector value."
msgstr "研究は {finding}。札の交通機能は理論上消失。収集価値は保証しない。"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:94
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.author"
msgid "Bamboo Navigation Club"
msgstr "竹林オリエンテーリング部"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:94
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.title"
msgid "This week: find your hall without numbers"
msgstr "今週訓練：数字なしで帰寮"

#. incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:94
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.fourth-lantern-loop.reactions.2.body"
msgid ""
"Following {ref}, the meeting point uses scent, wind, and one rabbit of "
"unverified reliability."
msgstr "{ref} を受け、集合点は匂い・風向・信頼性未保証の兎で記述。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.location
#: src/data/incidents.js:104
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.location"
msgid "Misty Lake Library · North windows"
msgstr "霧の湖図書館・北翼窓区"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:105
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.title"
msgid "Four flying books left together; only one meant to escape"
msgstr "飛行蔵書四冊が同時離架、逃亡希望は一冊だけ"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.lede
#: src/data/incidents.js:106
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.lede"
msgid ""
"After a window opened, four autonomous holdings flew lakeward. Three circled "
"back; the fourth negotiated a new shelf with fairies. Staff want volition "
"separated from airflow and imitation."
msgstr "開窓後、自律蔵書四冊が湖へ。三冊は旋回後帰館、四冊目は妖精と新棚を交渉。司書は意思・気流・追随の分離を要求。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.dispatch
#: src/data/incidents.js:107
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.dispatch"
msgid ""
"North windows are limited to ten centimetres. Nets are for books without an "
"intention to return."
msgstr "北翼窓は10cmまで。捕獲網は自発帰還意思のない本にのみ使用。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.affected
#: src/data/incidents.js:108
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.affected"
msgid "4 holdings, 19 readers, and 1 unfinished shelf negotiation"
msgstr "蔵書4冊・読者19名・未終結の棚交渉1件"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.signal
#: src/data/incidents.js:109
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.signal"
msgid "Probability of leaving shelf after window opening"
msgstr "開窓後離架確率"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.unit
#: src/data/incidents.js:110
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.unit"
msgid "percentage points"
msgstr "パーセントポイント"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.0.pressure-flock.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:114
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.0.pressure-flock.1"
msgid "Pressure moved one book and three followed"
msgstr "気圧が一冊を運び、三冊が追随"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.0.pressure-flock.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:114
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.0.pressure-flock.2"
msgid ""
"Departures differ by under 0.4 seconds, but only the first clasp experienced "
"outward pressure first."
msgstr "離架差は0.4秒未満。最初の一冊だけ留具に外向圧差。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.1.shelf-protest.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:115
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.1.shelf-protest.1"
msgid "A collective protest against the north shelf"
msgstr "四冊による北翼棚への共同抗議"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.1.shelf-protest.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:115
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.1.shelf-protest.2"
msgid ""
"The fourth filed for relocation; the other three only signed a margin, whose "
"validity is disputed."
msgstr "第四冊は移架申請済み。他三冊は欄外署名のみで効力係争中。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.2.fairy-lure.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:116
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.2.fairy-lure.1"
msgid "Lake fairies lured books with story endings"
msgstr "湖上妖精が物語の結末で本を誘引"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.2.fairy-lure.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:116
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.hypotheses.2.fairy-lure.2"
msgid ""
"Three contradictory endings were heard outside. Only the fourth is "
"catalogued as disliking unfinished stories."
msgstr "窓外で矛盾する結末三種を録音。第四冊のみ目録に「未完嫌い」。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:119
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.2"
msgid "Millisecond clasp tension"
msgstr "四留具のミリ秒張力"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:119
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.3"
msgid ""
"Book one received 1.8 N outward force; the other three released themselves "
"310–390 ms later."
msgstr "一冊目に1.8N外力、他三冊は310–390ms後に自発解錠。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:119
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.0.clasp-telemetry.4"
msgid "Misty Lake Cataloguing"
msgstr "霧の湖目録室"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:120
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.2"
msgid "Window pressure and wind slips"
msgstr "窓隙圧差・風向紙"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:120
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.3"
msgid "The pressure could move one light holding, not four simultaneously."
msgstr "開窓時圧差は軽量本一冊を動かせるが四冊同時には不足。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:120
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.1.window-log.4"
msgid "Kappa Facilities"
msgstr "河童施設班"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:121
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.2"
msgid "Relocation signatures in Flying Books"
msgstr "『飛ぶ本』欄外移架連署"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:121
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.3"
msgid ""
"The fourth wrote a complete request. The other signatures appeared two "
"minutes after departure."
msgstr "第四冊は完全な請求。他三冊の署名墨は離架二分後。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:121
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.2.margin-petition.4"
msgid "Librarian scene copy"
msgstr "司書現場写し"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:122
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.2"
msgid "Three story endings over the lake"
msgstr "湖上の三つの結末"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:122
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.3"
msgid ""
"The first ending came after departure, the second was supplied by a book, "
"and the fairy forgot the third."
msgstr "第一結末は離架後、第二は本自身が補完、第三は妖精が失念。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:122
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.evidence.3.fairy-audio.4"
msgid "North-window soundscape"
msgstr "北窓音景録音"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:125
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.1"
msgid "Koakuma"
msgstr "小悪魔"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:125
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.2"
msgid "Duty librarian"
msgstr "当直司書"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:125
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.3"
msgid ""
"One book blown out is facilities; three following is collection behaviour; "
"the fourth refusing to return is personnel."
msgstr "一冊が風で出るのは施設、三冊が追うのは蔵書行動、四冊目が戻らないのは人事問題。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:125
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.0.librarian.4"
msgid "Clear classification, but sequence may have been reconstructed after telemetry."
msgstr "分類は明瞭だが張力記録確認後に順序を再構成した可能性。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:126
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.1"
msgid "Fourth holding (answered by page turns)"
msgstr "第四蔵書（頁めくり回答）"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:126
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.2"
msgid "Departing holding"
msgstr "離架者"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:126
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.3"
msgid ""
"It opened to “not every departure is escape,” then displayed its call number "
"toward the library."
msgstr "「すべての離脱が逃亡ではない」を開き、請求記号を図書館側へ示した。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:126
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.1.book-four.4"
msgid "It intends to remain in the collection while demanding relocation."
msgstr "館籍維持意思はあるが移架要求継続。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:127
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.1"
msgid "Cirno"
msgstr "チルノ"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:127
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.2"
msgid "Lake witness"
msgstr "湖上目撃者"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:127
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.3"
msgid ""
"I did not lure the books. I only told them the strongest story endings "
"always contain me."
msgstr "本を誘ってない。最強の物語の結末には必ず私がいると教えただけ。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:127
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.testimony.2.cirno.4"
msgid "Her denial and description differ by one verb."
msgstr "否認と行為説明の差が動詞一つ。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:130
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.1"
msgid "Fit removable pressure baffles"
msgstr "着脱式風圧板を設置"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:130
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.2"
msgid "Keep ventilation while reducing the force on the first book."
msgstr "換気を保ち最初の受動離架力を低減。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:130
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.0.window-baffle.3"
msgid "Writing on the baffle may cause it to join the collection."
msgstr "板に文字を書くと蔵書化する可能性。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:131
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.1"
msgid "Run one-book-at-a-time window controls"
msgstr "一冊ずつ開窓対照"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:131
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.2"
msgid "Separate following from protest; books may refuse at any time."
msgstr "追随と共同抗議を分け、本は随時拒否可。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:131
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.1.single-book-trials.3"
msgid "Patchouli wants refusals counted as missing, not uncooperative."
msgstr "パチュリーは拒否本を非協力でなく欠測扱いと要求。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:132
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.1"
msgid "Mediate the fourth book’s shelf request first"
msgstr "第四冊の移架調停を先行"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:132
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.2"
msgid ""
"Address long-running dissatisfaction before the next trial instead of "
"treating volition as noise."
msgstr "次試行前に長期不満を処理し、意思を雑音扱いしない。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:132
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.2.shelf-mediation.3"
msgid "The former shelf also requests representation."
msgstr "元の書架も調停参加を要求。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:133
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.1"
msgid "One hour without story endings outside"
msgstr "窓外の物語結末を一時間停止"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:133
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.2"
msgid "Fairies may sing the body, but postpone endings."
msgstr "妖精は本文を歌えるが結末は一時禁止。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:133
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.actions.3.ending-silence.3"
msgid "The choir plans to rename endings as preludes."
msgstr "合唱団は結末を前奏へ改称予定。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:136
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.author"
msgid "Misty Lake Incident Desk"
msgstr "霧の湖図書館事案机"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:136
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.title"
msgid "North-window departure case closed: {finding}"
msgstr "北窓離架事案を終結：{finding}"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:136
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.0.body"
msgid "First action: {action}. File {ref}. A book’s relocation request remains a valid request."
msgstr "先行措置：{action}。記録 {ref}。本の移架意見は引き続き有効。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:137
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.author"
msgid "Autonomous Holdings Group"
msgstr "自律蔵書研究班"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:137
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.title"
msgid "Is following another book an act of volition?"
msgstr "追随は本の意思か？期末報告募集"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:137
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.1.body"
msgid ""
"{ref} found {finding}. Papers may not use the capture net as their only "
"operational definition."
msgstr "{ref} は {finding} と判断。捕獲網を唯一の操作定義にしないこと。"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:138
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.author"
msgid "Fairy Choir"
msgstr "妖精合唱団"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:138
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.title"
msgid "Tonight: only the first 99% of each story; books welcome"
msgstr "今夜は物語の99%まで。本の聴講歓迎"

#. incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:138
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.flying-book-window.reactions.2.body"
msgid "To support {action}, endings are stored somewhere without windows. Do not ask where."
msgstr "{action} に協力し、結末は窓のない場所へ保管。場所は質問しないこと。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.location
#: src/data/incidents.js:148
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.location"
msgid "Tengu Press Tower · Hieda History Hall"
msgstr "天狗新聞楼・稗田史学館"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:149
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.title"
msgid "The paper published tomorrow’s event; the chronicle filed it as yesterday"
msgstr "学報が明日の事件を掲載、大学史はすでに昨日として収録"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.lede
#: src/data/incidents.js:150
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.lede"
msgid ""
"A report of an unoccurred workshop explosion appeared in the morning paper. "
"A later explosion differed in time and cause, while the chronicle indexed "
"both versions under yesterday."
msgstr "未発生の工房爆発記事が朝刊へ。後に実際の爆発が起きたが時刻・原因は記事と異なる。大学史索引は両版を昨日へ収録。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.dispatch
#: src/data/incidents.js:151
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.dispatch"
msgid ""
"The workshop remains open, but prophetic reporting is not a substitute for "
"safety checks."
msgstr "工房は開放継続。ただし予言的記事を安全点検の代用にしない。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.affected
#: src/data/incidents.js:152
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.affected"
msgid "1 workshop, 2 incident versions, and 6 corrections citing each other"
msgstr "工房1棟・事案版2種・相互引用する訂正6件"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.signal
#: src/data/incidents.js:153
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.signal"
msgid "Agreement between report details and actual event"
msgstr "記事詳細と実事案の一致率"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.unit
#: src/data/incidents.js:154
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.unit"
msgid "percentage points"
msgstr "パーセントポイント"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.0.cache-mix.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:158
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.0.cache-mix.1"
msgid "Layout cache mixed in a previous simulated incident"
msgstr "学報組版キャッシュに前回模擬事案が混入"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.0.cache-mix.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:158
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.0.cache-mix.2"
msgid ""
"The report time matches last week’s simulation; only the location was "
"replaced with today’s duty workshop."
msgstr "記事時刻は先週の研究模擬と一致し、場所だけ当日当番工房へ自動置換。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.1.aya-forecast.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:159
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.1.aya-forecast.1"
msgid "Aya forecast the incident from wind and interviews"
msgstr "文が風向と取材から事案を予測"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.1.aya-forecast.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:159
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.1.aya-forecast.2"
msgid ""
"She knew about valve noise, but blamed mushroom fuel; the actual trigger was "
"gear-cut lotus root."
msgstr "圧力弁異音は把握していたが、記事は茸燃料、実際は歯車蓮根。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.2.history-pull.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:160
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.2.history-pull.1"
msgid "The chronicle’s yesterday index pulled events toward the written version"
msgstr "大学史の昨日索引が事案を既述版へ引いた"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.2.history-pull.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:160
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.hypotheses.2.history-pull.2"
msgid "Similarity rose briefly after indexing, though the causal order may run the other way."
msgstr "索引作成後に類似度が一時上昇。ただし順序は逆かもしれない。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:163
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.2"
msgid "Layout cache manifest"
msgstr "組版機キャッシュ目録"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:163
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.3"
msgid ""
"`incident-final2-use-this` was created in last week’s lab and mistaken by "
"the template for the latest approved version this morning."
msgstr "incident-final2-use-this は先週の研究授業作成。今朝テンプレートが最新承認版と誤認。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:163
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.0.layout-cache.4"
msgid "Tengu Press layout machine"
msgstr "天狗新聞楼組版機"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:164
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.2"
msgid "Pre-incident valve soundscape"
msgstr "事案前圧力弁音景"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:164
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.3"
msgid ""
"Noise existed before publication and supports generic risk prediction, not "
"the exact time or mushroom cause."
msgstr "異音は記事前に存在し一般的リスク予測を支持。ただし正確な時刻・茸原因は支持せず。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:164
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.1.valve-audio.4"
msgid "Aya’s recorder"
msgstr "文の個人録音筆"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:165
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.2"
msgid "Gear-cut lotus lodged in the valve"
msgstr "圧力弁に詰まった歯車蓮根"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:165
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.3"
msgid ""
"It came from South Dining and was used as a spare part, unrelated to the "
"report’s mushroom fuel."
msgstr "南食堂カレー由来。学生が予備部品に使用。記事の茸燃料とは無関係。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:165
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.2.lotus-gear.4"
msgid "Kappa Workshop evidence bag"
msgstr "河童工房封印袋"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:166
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.2"
msgid "Creation time of the ‘yesterday’ index"
msgstr "「昨日」索引作成時刻"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:166
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.3"
msgid ""
"The index was created seven minutes after cache load and nineteen before the "
"real explosion. It records the report; it need not have caused it."
msgstr "索引はキャッシュ読込7分後、実爆発19分前に作成。記事を記録したが記事を生んだとは限らない。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:166
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.evidence.3.chronicle-index.4"
msgid "Hieda History Hall"
msgstr "稗田史学館"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:169
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.1"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:169
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.2"
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "主筆"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:169
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.3"
msgid ""
"The cache supplied details; I supplied judgment. The judgment later became "
"partly right, which journalism cannot call wholly wrong."
msgstr "キャッシュは細部、判断は私。判断は後に一部当たったので報道上全部誤りではない。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:169
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.0.aya-press.4"
msgid "Combines forecast, template failure, and later coincidence in one sentence."
msgstr "予測・テンプレ事故・事後的中を一文で混合。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:170
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.1"
msgid "Hieda no Akyuu"
msgstr "稗田阿求"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:170
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.2"
msgid "Index keeper"
msgstr "索引管理"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:170
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.3"
msgid ""
"The chronicle says “reported yesterday,” not “happened yesterday.” Someone "
"shortened the column label."
msgstr "大学史は「昨日報じられた」と記録し、「昨日発生」とはしていない。欄名が短縮された。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:170
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.1.akyuu.4"
msgid "The interface truncates the index semantics; the source remains available."
msgstr "索引意味がUIで切断、底本は確認可能。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:171
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.1"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城にとり"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:171
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.2"
msgid "Workshop lead"
msgstr "工房責任者"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:171
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.3"
msgid ""
"After the prediction, everyone checked mushrooms and nobody checked lunch. "
"Prophecy can point safety work the wrong way."
msgstr "爆発記事後、皆が茸を点検し昼食を見なかった。予言は安全点検を誤方向へ導く。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:171
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.testimony.2.nitori-workshop.4"
msgid "The report changed the subsequent inspection path."
msgstr "記事自体が後続点検経路を変更。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:174
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.1"
msgid "Archive and clear the layout cache"
msgstr "組版キャッシュを封印・消去"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:174
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.2"
msgid "Keep traceable images and allow templates to read only stamped versions."
msgstr "追跡可能な像を保存し、承認印付き版のみ読取。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:174
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.0.purge-cache.3"
msgid "Aya wants an exemption for the Inspiration Sources folder."
msgstr "文は「着想源」フォルダの除外を要求。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:175
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.1"
msgid "Separate forecasts from occurred-event reports"
msgstr "予測と発生済記事を別欄化"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:175
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.2"
msgid "Use distinct labels on one page; corrections may not merge them."
msgstr "同じ紙面で標識を分け、訂正時も統合不可。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:175
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.1.forecast-label.3"
msgid "Readers may still forward only the headline."
msgstr "読者は見出しだけ転送しうる。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:176
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.1"
msgid "Separate naming domains for lab and newsroom versions"
msgstr "研究模擬と新聞組版の版名領域を分離"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:176
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.2"
msgid "Lab files may no longer be final; newsroom files may no longer be maybe."
msgstr "模擬資料はfinal禁止、新聞資料はmaybe禁止。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:176
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.2.version-lock.3"
msgid "Marisa has already named hers definitely-not-final."
msgstr "魔理沙は definitely-not-final と命名済み。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:177
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.1"
msgid "Trigger an independent safety checklist after predictive reports"
msgstr "予言記事で独立安全表を起動"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:177
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.2"
msgid "Recheck materials, pressure, and lunch without inheriting the article’s proposed cause."
msgstr "記事の原因を引き継がず、材料・圧力・昼食を再点検。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:177
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.actions.3.independent-check.3"
msgid "South Dining asks not to classify every lunch as hazardous material."
msgstr "南食堂は全昼食を危険物扱いしないよう要求。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:180
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.author"
msgid "Chronicle–Press Joint Corrections"
msgstr "大学史・報道合同訂正机"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:180
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.title"
msgid "Tomorrow-explosion report case closed: {finding}"
msgstr "明日爆発記事事案を終結：{finding}"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:180
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.0.body"
msgid ""
"First action: {action}. File {ref}. “Reported” and “occurred” are separate "
"columns again."
msgstr "先行措置：{action}。記録 {ref}。「報じられた」と「発生済」を二欄へ復元。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:181
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.author"
msgid "News Methods TA"
msgstr "報道資料方法TA"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:181
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.title"
msgid "Final question: can partial prediction offset a cache failure?"
msgstr "期末問：部分的中はキャッシュ事故を相殺するか"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:181
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.1.body"
msgid "Cite {ref} and explain why a correct outcome does not replace an identifiable method."
msgstr "{ref} を引用し、的中結果が識別可能な方法を代替しない理由を説明。"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:182
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.author"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Campus News"
msgstr "文々。学報"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:182
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.title"
msgid "New column: Not Yet Happened but Worth Writing First"
msgstr "新欄「未発生だが先に書く価値あり」"

#. incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:182
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.headline-yesterday.reactions.2.body"
msgid ""
"Clearly labelled under {action}. The university declines to guarantee the "
"label will not make events occur."
msgstr "{action} に従い明示。欄内事案が表示により発生しない保証は大学が拒否。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.location
#: src/data/incidents.js:192
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.location"
msgid "Boundary Annex · BA-YD window side"
msgstr "境界別館・BA-YD窓側"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:193
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.title"
msgid "The window chair in a roommate agreement applied as a third roommate"
msgstr "共同生活協定の窓辺椅子が第三同室者登録を要求"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.lede
#: src/data/incidents.js:194
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.lede"
msgid ""
"After a shared-living note was generated, the chair moved beneath the "
"signature line and scratched “I live here too.” Both residents accept it has "
"an opinion; they disagree on rent."
msgstr "共同生活メモ生成後、椅子が署名欄下へ移動し「私も住む」と傷で記した。二名は意見の存在に同意、寮費分担は不一致。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.dispatch
#: src/data/incidents.js:195
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.dispatch"
msgid ""
"The chair stays in place and gains a third rota row, but is not yet counted "
"in evacuation totals."
msgstr "椅子は現室に留め、窓辺当番表へ第三欄追加。避難人数には未算入。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.affected
#: src/data/incidents.js:196
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.affected"
msgid "2 residents, 1 chair, and 4 shared rules needing reinterpretation"
msgstr "居住者2名・椅子1脚・再解釈が必要な規則4条"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.signal
#: src/data/incidents.js:197
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.signal"
msgid "Unattended self-movements"
msgstr "無人時の自律移動回数"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.unit
#: src/data/incidents.js:198
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.unit"
msgid "per night"
msgstr "回／夜"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.0.emergent-tsukumogami.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:202
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.0.emergent-tsukumogami.1"
msgid "Long use and the new agreement prompted tsukumogami awakening"
msgstr "長期使用と新協定が付喪神覚醒を促進"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.0.emergent-tsukumogami.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:202
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.0.emergent-tsukumogami.2"
msgid ""
"The chair is at least ninety-nine years old and produced stable writing "
"after first being named in a formal rule."
msgstr "椅齢不明だが最低99年。制度文書で初めて言及された後、安定した文字を示す。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.1.matoi-phasing.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:203
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.1.matoi-phasing.1"
msgid "A roommate’s phasing unintentionally carried the chair"
msgstr "同室者の壁抜けが椅子を境界越しに移動"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.1.matoi-phasing.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:203
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.1.matoi-phasing.2"
msgid "Matoi phases through the same wall nightly; the chair legs carry matching boundary dust."
msgstr "境縫まといが毎晩同じ壁を抜け、椅子脚に同じ境界粉。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.2.familiar-prank.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:204
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.2.familiar-prank.1"
msgid "A small familiar moved and wrote for the chair"
msgstr "小型使い魔が椅子を動かし筆記"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.2.familiar-prank.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:204
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.hypotheses.2.familiar-prank.2"
msgid ""
"A fire mouse can enter unattended and matches scratch height, but the "
"wording uses a furniture first person."
msgstr "火鼠は無人時に入室でき傷高も一致。ただし文は家具の一人称。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:207
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.2"
msgid "Seven-night chalk coordinates"
msgstr "七夜の白墨座標"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:207
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.3"
msgid ""
"The chair moved on five nights; Matoi was away for two, and the fire mouse "
"was confined at a shrine event for one."
msgstr "五夜移動。うち二夜まとい不在、一夜火鼠は神社行事で封鎖。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:207
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.0.night-grid.4"
msgid "Hall council"
msgstr "寮自治会"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:208
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.2"
msgid "Lettering scratched by a chair leg"
msgstr "椅子脚の傷文字"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:208
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.3"
msgid ""
"Each stroke begins under the chair’s full weight with no claw-tip marks; "
"letter shapes follow floor seams."
msgstr "各画始点に椅子全重、爪先圧痕なし。字形は床目地に制約。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:208
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.1.scratch-text.4"
msgid "Kappa Materials Room"
msgstr "河童材料室"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:209
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.2"
msgid "Boundary dust on chair and wall seam"
msgstr "椅子脚・壁隙の境界粉"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:209
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.3"
msgid ""
"The dust shares a source but could come from repeated wall contact; it does "
"not alone prove phasing transport."
msgstr "同源だが反復接触でも付着し、壁抜け移動の単独証拠ではない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:209
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.2.boundary-dust.4"
msgid "Boundaries & Incidents"
msgstr "境界・異変研究院"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:210
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.2"
msgid "Faded Kourindou receipt from ninety-nine years ago"
msgstr "香霖堂99年前の不鮮明領収書"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:210
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.3"
msgid ""
"The item reads only “long chair or short table.” The date is reliable; the "
"object match is disputed."
msgstr "品名は「長椅子又は短机」のみ。日付は高信頼、物件対応は係争。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:210
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.evidence.3.old-receipt.4"
msgid "Found beneath the seat"
msgstr "座面下から発見"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:213
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.1"
msgid "Matoi Sakaime"
msgstr "境縫まとい"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:213
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.2"
msgid "Resident"
msgstr "居住者"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:213
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.3"
msgid ""
"I called it shared furniture. After it spoke, “shared” may need "
"renegotiation. I did not carry it through a wall."
msgstr "以前は共用家具と呼んだ。意見後は「共用」を再協議すべき。ただし壁抜けで運んでいない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:213
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.0.matoi-room.4"
msgid "Accepts the identity question, denies the physical cause."
msgstr "身分問題は認め、物理原因は否認。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:214
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.1"
msgid "Chacha Senya"
msgstr "千夜ちゃちゃ"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:214
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.2"
msgid "Resident / tsukumogami"
msgstr "居住者・付喪神"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:214
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.3"
msgid ""
"I was a bench too. It writes slowly, but furniture lacking hands does not "
"mean it lacks opinions."
msgstr "私も元は長椅子。書くのは遅いが、家具に手がないことは意見がないことではない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:214
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.1.chacha.4"
msgid "Relevant lived experience with possible strong projection."
msgstr "関連経験がある一方、自身の歴史を強く投影する可能性。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:215
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.1"
msgid "Fire mouse (translated from singed slips)"
msgstr "小火鼠（焦げ紙から翻訳）"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:215
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.2"
msgid "Suspected familiar"
msgstr "疑われた使い魔"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:215
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.3"
msgid "“I take socks. Chair too big.”"
msgstr "「靴下だけ。椅子は大きすぎる」"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.4
#: src/data/incidents.js:215
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.testimony.2.fire-mouse.4"
msgid "Brief and consistent; does not answer whether it wrote for the chair."
msgstr "短く一貫。代筆の有無は未回答。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:218
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.1"
msgid "Low-stimulus unattended observation"
msgstr "無人室の低刺激観察"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:218
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.2"
msgid "Do not restrain the chair; use a non-luminous chalk grid and mechanical shutter."
msgstr "椅子を固定せず、非発光白墨格子と機械式シャッターを使用。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:218
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.0.empty-room-camera.3"
msgid "The camera may not pre-classify the chair as object or participant."
msgstr "カメラは椅子を物体・参加者のどちらとも先決しない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:219
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.1"
msgid "Two-night no-phasing control"
msgstr "同室者が二夜壁抜け停止で対照"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:219
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.2"
msgid "Provide an ordinary key and compare whether the chair still moves."
msgstr "通常鍵を提供し椅子移動を比較。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:219
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.1.phase-control.3"
msgid "Matoi says using a door makes her four seconds late."
msgstr "まといは扉使用で通常より4秒遅れると申告。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:220
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.1"
msgid "Alternate familiar-present and familiar-absent nights"
msgstr "使い魔在室・不在室を交互化"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:220
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.2"
msgid "Register the fire mouse’s location rather than using missing socks as tracking."
msgstr "火鼠位置を事前登録し、靴下消失を追跡代用にしない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:220
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.2.familiar-control.3"
msgid "The mouse refuses an ID tag larger than itself."
msgstr "火鼠は自身より大きい名札を拒否。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:221
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.1"
msgid "Grant the chair a provisional resident seat"
msgstr "椅子へ暫定居住者席"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.2
#: src/data/incidents.js:221
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.2"
msgid "Allow it into furniture rotas and agreements during study without deciding rent."
msgstr "研究中は家具当番・協定参加を認め、寮費は未決。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.3
#: src/data/incidents.js:221
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.actions.3.provisional-seat.3"
msgid "May alter behaviour, but avoids treating a possible resident as mere apparatus."
msgstr "行動を変えるが、潜在的居住者を単なる計器扱いしない。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:224
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.author"
msgid "Boundary Annex Hall Council"
msgstr "境界別館自治会"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:224
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.title"
msgid "BA-YD chair case closed: {finding}"
msgstr "BA-YD椅子事案を終結：{finding}"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:224
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.0.body"
msgid ""
"Interim action: {action}. File {ref}. The rent question goes to the next "
"meeting table that does not collapse."
msgstr "暫定措置：{action}。記録 {ref}。寮費問題は次の壊れない会議机へ。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:225
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.author"
msgid "Window Chair (typed by Chacha)"
msgstr "窓辺椅子（千夜代筆）"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:225
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.title"
msgid "Not for sale, not for trade, not a common resource"
msgstr "非売・交換不可・共用資源でもない"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:225
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.1.body"
msgid "The study provisionally finds {finding}. Also, the Tuesday window slot is mine."
msgstr "研究は暫定的に {finding}。なお火曜の窓辺枠は私のもの。"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.author
#: src/data/incidents.js:226
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.author"
msgid "Faith & Coexistence Policy"
msgstr "信仰・共生政策学部"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.title
#: src/data/incidents.js:226
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.title"
msgid "Pop-up seminar: when furniture becomes a stakeholder"
msgstr "臨時講義：家具が利害関係者になる時"

#. incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.body
#: src/data/incidents.js:226
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.dorm-window-chair.reactions.2.body"
msgid ""
"Using {ref}: Kanako asks about infrastructure, Byakuren coexistence, and "
"Miko wants the chair to state its desire."
msgstr "{ref} を事例に、神奈子は基盤、白蓮は共生、神子は椅子の欲望説明を要求。"

