#. incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.name
#: src/data/incidents.js:249
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.name"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.role
#: src/data/incidents.js:250
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.role"
msgid "Journalism · Headline Already Typeset"
msgstr "新聞学部・見出し組版済席"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.note
#: src/data/incidents.js:251
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.aya.note"
msgid ""
"The study not supporting it is one matter; readers already being supported "
"by the headline is another. Preserve both until Corrections catches up."
msgstr "研究が支持しないことと、読者が見出しに支持されてしまったことは別問題。訂正欄が追いつくまで、両方保存すべきだ。"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.name
#: src/data/incidents.js:254
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.name"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨魔理沙"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.role
#: src/data/incidents.js:255
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.role"
msgid "Magic Practice · Wall-struck Hypothesis Seat"
msgstr "魔法実習・壁衝突仮説保存席"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.note
#: src/data/incidents.js:256
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.marisa.note"
msgid ""
"A hypothesis that hit a wall still tells the next person where the wall is. "
"Keep it, but do not rename the wall an exit."
msgstr "壁に当たった仮説は、次の者へ壁の位置を教える。残してよいが、壁を出口と改名するのは禁止だ。"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.name
#: src/data/incidents.js:259
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.name"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo"
msgstr "八雲紫"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.role
#: src/data/incidents.js:260
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.role"
msgid "Boundary Studies · Indistinguishable Seat"
msgstr "境界研究・識別不能席"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.note
#: src/data/incidents.js:261
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.yukari.note"
msgid ""
"Failing to distinguish two explanations proves neither that both are absent "
"nor that either exists. It belongs precisely between those statements."
msgstr "二つの説明を区別できないことは、両方が存在しない証明でも、存在する証明でもない。ちょうど二文の境に保存する価値がある。"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.name
#: src/data/incidents.js:264
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.name"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa"
msgstr "上白沢慧音"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.role
#: src/data/incidents.js:265
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.role"
msgid "History & Records · Red-thread Binding Seat"
msgstr "歴史記録・赤糸綴じ席"

#. incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.note
#: src/data/incidents.js:266
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReviewers.keine.note"
msgid ""
"Failure may be preserved, but the filename, conclusion, and every later "
"citation must retain “not supported.” Lose one word and it returns for "
"rebinding."
msgstr "失敗は保存できる。ただしファイル名・結論・後の引用すべてに「支持されず」を残すこと。一字でも欠ければ再製本だ。"

#. incidentRetentionReasons.counterexample
#: src/data/incidents.js:271
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReasons.counterexample"
msgid "Preserve as counterexample: show the next round which path failed"
msgstr "反例として保存：次回へ通れない道を示す"

#. incidentRetentionReasons.method
#: src/data/incidents.js:272
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReasons.method"
msgid "Preserve as method failure: the error teaches calibration and version control"
msgstr "方法事故として保存：誤りから校正・版管理を学ぶ"

#. incidentRetentionReasons.public
#: src/data/incidents.js:273
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReasons.public"
msgid "Preserve as public controversy: the rumour exists, and deletion would make it look truer"
msgstr "公共争議として保存：噂は既に発生し、削除すればさらに真実らしくなる"

#. incidentRetentionReasons.headline
#: src/data/incidents.js:274
msgctxt "text:incidentRetentionReasons.headline"
msgid "Preserve because the headline is printed: Corrections may catch up later"
msgstr "見出し印刷済みのため保存：訂正欄は後から追いつく"
